  "Question": "Rationalize the denominator: \\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}}=k(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3})\\). What is the value of \\(k\\)? (Write your answer as a fraction in lowest terms.)",
